    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greetings from Felicia Bay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for Bus Simulator 27, the most advanced entry in the history of the franchise. Look forward to our most comprehensive bus fleet yet \u2014 with new officially licensed brands and models, as well as iconic buses from the series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant new open world inspired by the Iberian Peninsula, featuring distinct districts, busy streets, and impressive landmarks \u2014 all brought to life with Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're behind the wheel, walking the streets or riding as a passenger, the city is yours to discover. Plan custom routes and manage your growing business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with friends in 4-player co-operative mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now to stay updated on everything coming \u2014 including officially licensed buses, manufacturers, and exciting new features. More about Bus Simulator 27 will be revealed soon!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greetings from Felicia Bay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for Bus Simulator 27, the most advanced entry in the history of the franchise. Look forward to our most comprehensive bus fleet yet \u2014 with new officially licensed brands and models, as well as iconic buses from the series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant new open world inspired by the Iberian Peninsula, featuring distinct districts, busy streets, and impressive landmarks \u2014 all brought to life with Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're behind the wheel, walking the streets or riding as a passenger, the city is yours to discover. Plan custom routes and manage your growing business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with friends in 4-player co-operative mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now to stay updated on everything coming \u2014 including officially licensed buses, manufacturers, and exciting new features. More about Bus Simulator 27 will be revealed soon!</p>",
